{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1792502261, "env": {"TERM": "xterm-ghostty"}}
[0.010663, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.010769, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.010784, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m  1 \u00b7 DRA\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.0108, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.013095, "o", "\u001b[2m  recorded run \u00b7 Tue 20 Oct 2026, 15:17 CEST\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.015252, "o", "\u001b[35m\ud83d\udde3  Before DRA, a GPU is a node label and a count: you can ask for one GPU, not for one with at \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[35m    least 14 GiB.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.01761, "o", "\u001b[35m\ud83d\udde3  With DRA the driver publishes every device with typed attributes, and a pod claims one by \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[35m    what it is, in CEL.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.07314, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 Before DRA: the node carries a label, the pod asks for a count\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.073791, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl --kubeconfig .secrets/aks-swedencentral.kubeconfig get nodes \\\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.073809, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m    -l nvidia.com/gpu.present=true -L nvidia.com/gpu.product\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.402412, "o", "  NAME                              GPU.PRODUCT\r\n  aks-gpua100-32161946-vmss000000   NVIDIA-A100-80GB-PCIe\r\n"]
[0.403941, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.404007, "m", "ENTER"]
[0.404023, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 With DRA: the driver publishes each device\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.404589, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl --kubeconfig .secrets/aks-swedencentral.kubeconfig get resourceslices -o yaml\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.404608, "o", "\u001b[2m  the GPU driver's slice, abridged:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.703986, "o", "  \u001b[36mspec\u001b[0m:\r\n    \u001b[36mdriver\u001b[0m: gpu.nvidia.com\r\n"]
[0.704052, "o", "    \u001b[36mnodeName\u001b[0m: aks-gpua100-32161946-vmss000000\r\n    \u001b[36mdevices\u001b[0m:\r\n      - \u001b[36mname\u001b[0m: gpu-0\r\n        \u001b[36mattributes\u001b[0m:\r\n          \u001b[36marchitecture\u001b[0m:\r\n            \u001b[36mstring\u001b[0m: Ampere\r\n          \u001b[36mcudaComputeCapability\u001b[0m:\r\n            \u001b[36mversion\u001b[0m: 8.0.0\r\n          \u001b[36mproductName\u001b[0m:\r\n            \u001b[36mstring\u001b[0m: NVIDIA A100 80GB PCIe\r\n        \u001b[36mcapacity\u001b[0m:\r\n          \u001b[36mmemory\u001b[0m:\r\n            \u001b[36mvalue\u001b[0m: 80Gi\r\n"]
[0.704539, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.704579, "m", "ENTER"]
[0.704591, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 The engine pod claims a device by what it is\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.985191, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl --kubeconfig .secrets/aks-swedencentral.kubeconfig \\\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.985251, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m    -n mp-ml-team-51733 get resourceclaim \\\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m    qwen-7b-ba0ae-qwen-7b-b0315-568c78c558-7xrhm-devices-tfztx -o yaml\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.266319, "o", "  \u001b[36mspec\u001b[0m:\r\n    \u001b[36mrequest\u001b[0m:\r\n      \u001b[36mdeviceClassName\u001b[0m: gpu.nvidia.com\r\n"]
[1.266388, "o", "      \u001b[36mselectors\u001b[0m:\r\n        - |\r\n          device.capacity[\"gpu.nvidia.com\"].memory.compareTo(quantity(\"14Gi\")) >= 0\r\n  \u001b[36mstatus\u001b[0m:\r\n    \u001b[36mallocated\u001b[0m:\r\n      - \u001b[36mdriver\u001b[0m: gpu.nvidia.com\r\n        \u001b[36mpool\u001b[0m: aks-gpua100-32161946-vmss000000\r\n        \u001b[36mdevice\u001b[0m: gpu-0\r\n"]
[1.266943, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.267064, "m", "ENTER"]
[1.267114, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 Modelplane checks the same CEL one level up, against each InferenceClass\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.300394, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl get inferenceclass a100-1x -o yaml\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.330044, "o", "  \u001b[36mspec\u001b[0m:\r\n    \u001b[36mdevices\u001b[0m:\r\n      - \u001b[36mname\u001b[0m: gpu\r\n        \u001b[36mclaim\u001b[0m: DRA\r\n        \u001b[36mdriver\u001b[0m: gpu.nvidia.com\r\n"]
[1.330092, "o", "        \u001b[36mattributes\u001b[0m:\r\n          \u001b[36marchitecture\u001b[0m:\r\n            \u001b[36mstring\u001b[0m: Ampere\r\n          \u001b[36mcudaComputeCapability\u001b[0m:\r\n            \u001b[36mversion\u001b[0m: 8.0.0\r\n        \u001b[36mcapacity\u001b[0m:\r\n          \u001b[36mmemory\u001b[0m:\r\n            \u001b[36mvalue\u001b[0m: 81920Mi\r\n"]
[1.358896, "o", "\u001b[2m  The deployment's selector: device.capacity[\"gpu.nvidia.com\"].memory.compareTo(quantity(\"14Gi\")) >= 0\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.358939, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[32m\ud83d\udca1 The same CEL decides twice: Modelplane picks the cluster and pool, DRA binds the GPU.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
